 "applies_to": "AbsolutAire heating and ventilating units with the UC-3 HTLV control system.",
 "summary": "The UC-3 HTLV is AbsolutAire's controller for heat-and-vent make-up air units: it runs the burner to hold a discharge or space temperature, with occupied/unoccupied setpoints, a low-temperature limit and a mild-weather heat lockout. It joins a BACnet MS/TP network with the MAC address set on DIP switches. The BMS enables the unit through NetworkUnitEnable, sets occupancy and vent/heat mode, and writes the space and discharge setpoints.",
 "bacnet_transport": [
  "BACnet MS/TP"
 ],
